{"products":[{"id":7750008635444,"title":"Tarot Pendant","handle":"tarot-pendant","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eDesigned and illustrated by Pamela Colman Smith, the Rider-Waite Tarot Deck is one of the most iconic and enduring interpretations of the tarot. Each card carries a distinct energy, offering guidance through symbolism, archetypes, and ancient wisdom — an energy we've magnified with hand-selected, hand-set natural gemstones that echo the cards' meanings.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eI: The Magician:\u003c\/strong\u003e A symbol of resourcefulness and the power to inspire action. Connecting the spiritual and physical realms, the Magician manifests what is desired and births them into reality. Set on a slab of lapis, a gemstone of truth and wisdom, this piece is a reminder that you already have everything you need to tap into limitless potential.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eII: The High Priestess: \u003c\/strong\u003eThe guardian of hidden knowledge. She bridges the conscious and subconscious, set on a slab of white mother of pearl to call in insight and divine knowledge. Wear her to strengthen your connection to intuition, mystery, and inner knowing.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIII: The Empress:\u003c\/strong\u003e An invitation to abundance, prosperity and sensuality. She embodies the peace and nurturing of the divine feminine, fostering creativity and wellbeing. Set on a slab of malachite, a gemstone of healing and protection, this piece is a safeguarding talisman that eases your path to plenty, while reminding you that you are deserving.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXIII: Death:\u003c\/strong\u003e A highly misunderstood card. Death signals endings and new beginnings, urging you to release what no longer serves you and embrace change. Set on a slab of black onyx, a protective gemstone of strength and renewal, this piece serves as a powerful reminder that every ending is the start of something new.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXV: The Devil: \u003c\/strong\u003eA wake-up call to reflect on limiting beliefs. Evaluate actions that amount to self-sabotage, and release temptations and restrictions. Set on a slab of black mother of pearl, a gemstone of emotional protection and balance, this piece is a reminder to free yourself of self-imposed limits and rewrite your destiny.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXVIII: The Moon: \u003c\/strong\u003eA card of intuition and illusion, The Moon symbolizes the interplay of what is felt and what is real. Reflecting the shifting tides of the subconscious, The Moon is set on a slab of abalone, a gemstone of depth and perception — reminding you to trust your instincts and navigate the unknown with wisdom.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXIX: The Sun: \u003c\/strong\u003eA welcome beacon of positivity and success, The Sun symbolizes a clear and joyful path ahead. The Sun radiates warmth and boundless potential, celebrating the promise of new beginnings set on a slab of turquoise, a gemstone of clarity and fortune.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe Three of Swords: \u003c\/strong\u003eA testament to the scars we cannot see, where grief and hurt wound the heart. The Three of Swords reminds us that pain can bring catharsis…and wisdom. Set on a slab of rainbow moonstone for healing and intuition, the Three of Swords reminds us to learn from every heartbreak, and derive strength from sorrow.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-09-14T06:42:22-07:00","created_at":"2025-03-10T09:08:30-07:00","updated_at":"2026-10-14T09:46:33-07:00","vendor":"Awe Inspired","product_type":"Pendants","tags":["260AWE426","26_05_MD_2","ARC_SALE_202609","category_Pendants","collection_Charms","collection_Pendants","ECLIPSE_26_03","GG25|CELESTIAL","Promo_444Charms","Promo_CMooncharms","Promo_LG","Shop_Bestseller","Shop_Timeless","W-Standard"],"variants":[{"id":47765670690868,"title":"14K Gold Vermeil 